cl-discord-self
===============

This project is a Common Lisp implementation informed by the protocol kernel
and behavioral contracts of dolfies/discord.py-self.

Upstream project: https://github.com/dolfies/discord.py-self
Upstream license: MIT
Upstream copyright notice: Copyright (c) 2015-present Rapptz

The exact compatibility baseline, translated-module inventory, generator
version, and source digests are recorded in the compatibility manifest once
Issue #2 pins an immutable upstream commit.

No upstream implementation module has been translated into this repository in
the Phase 0 bootstrap revision. Files added before the compatibility pin are
original repository scaffolding and contract definitions derived from the
approved StarIntel design documents.
